            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47987757?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Related to issue report <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5896832803\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/575192\">#575192</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am using nixos-hardware <code class=\"notranslate\">framework/13-inch/common/default.nix</code> profile, which fails with against <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/commit/fa60a5b07193de65811d4f041b5c7c8ea9593afc/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/commit/fa60a5b07193de65811d4f041b5c7c8ea9593afc\"><tt>fa60a5b</tt></a> which introduced recently via <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5739794155\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/571181\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/571181/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/571181\">#571181</a> module signatures</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"        &gt; kernel version is 7.2.11\n        &gt; cat: extra/framework_laptop.ko.cer: No such file or directory\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">        &gt; kernel version is 7.2.11\n        &gt; cat: extra/framework_laptop.ko.cer: No such file or directory\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remove copying the kernel module and lets Kbuild install (and thus sign) it, so the .ko.cer that the module aggregator expects actually exists.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage